  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Initiative for adolescents in Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA addresses the key challenges of early marriages and pregnancies in Niger, in order for the country to be able to capture its demographic dividend for the development and economic growth of the country. The programme intervenes both through the educational- and health sector, and works to change social norms among the population. There are three channels:  the &#x201c;Illimin Programme&quot; for young girls not in school, mobile health clinics for rural areas, and sexuality education in schools.</narrative>
  </description>
